# The harness's own state: the lock, the oracle definitions, the regression
# corpus and above all .prothesis/runs/, which every run adds a directory to.
# None of it is needed to compile the fixture, and with it inside the context
# every build's `COPY . .` misses the cache (OQ-068: 2.38 GB of a 2.40 GB
# context was run output, and one new file in it cost +5.4 GB of build cache).
.prothesis/
